---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Learn about Carla and the story behind handcrochetedbycarlaarias.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <p class="text-brown uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-3">The maker</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">About Carla</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="w-full sm:w-64 flex-shrink-0">
        <div class="aspect-square rounded-3xl bg-blush/40 overflow-hidden">
          <!-- Replace with Carla's photo -->
          <div class="w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center text-brown/30 text-sm">Photo coming soon</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1 space-y-4 text-brown/80 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Hi, I'm Carla! I'm a self-taught crocheter who fell in love with the craft and never looked back.
          What started as a hobby quickly turned into a passion for creating handmade pieces that people actually use and love.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every item I make is crocheted by hand — no machines, no shortcuts. I put thought into every stitch,
          every color choice, and every detail. Whether it's a cozy blanket, a playful amigurumi, or a tote bag you'll reach for every day,
          I want it to feel special.
        </p>
        <p>
          I take custom orders and love bringing people's ideas to life. If you have a vision, let's make it happen.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 text-center">
      <a href="/custom-orders" class="bg-brown text-cream px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-brown-dark transition-colors">
        Start a Custom Order
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
